    "Only limited snapshots viewed/selected by the user are included. Not live state, complete logs or a full audit. No additional Argo query was made. Unselected/unloaded evidence does not imply no incidents.": "Solo se incluyen instant\xE1neas limitadas vistas/seleccionadas por el usuario. No estado en vivo, registros completos o una auditor\xEDa completa. No se realiz\xF3 ninguna consulta adicional de Argo. La evidencia no seleccionada/descargada no implica que no haya incidentes.",
