    "Reading again starts a new fragment; continuity or deduplication against the previous fragment is not guaranteed.": "Tekrar okumak yeni bir par\xE7ay\u0131 ba\u015Flat\u0131r; \xF6nceki par\xE7aya kar\u015F\u0131 s\xFCreklilik veya veri tekille\u015Ftirme garanti edilmez.",
