    "Method not allowed.": "Y\xF6nteme izin verilmiyor.",
    "Service is busy; retry later.": "Servis me\u015Fgul; daha sonra tekrar deneyin.",
    "Operation exceeded its deadline.": "Operasyon s\xFCreyi a\u015Ft\u0131.",
    "Result exceeds the response limit.": "Sonu\xE7 yan\u0131t s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 a\u015F\u0131yor.",
    "Operation failed. Upstream details have been withheld.": "\u0130\u015Flem ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. Yukar\u0131 ak\u0131\u015F ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 gizlendi.",
    "CLI configuration is unavailable on the OpenChamber Server host.": "OpenChamber Sunucusu ana bilgisayar\u0131nda CLI yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131 mevcut de\u011Fil.",
    "Host configuration is invalid. Check it on the server; contents are not disclosed.": "Ana makine yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131 ge\xE7ersiz. Sunucuda kontrol edin; i\xE7erikleri a\xE7\u0131klanmad\u0131.",
    "Selected CLI context is unavailable.": "Se\xE7ilen CLI i\xE7eri\u011Fi kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.",
    "This connection mode is not supported. Kubernetes core mode cannot reuse an Argo CD token.": "Bu ba\u011Flant\u0131 modu desteklenmiyor. Kubernetes \xE7ekirdek modu Argo CD belirtecini yeniden kullanamaz.",
    "Argo CD network access is disabled in host settings; approval is required before validation.": "Argo CD a\u011F eri\u015Fimi ana bilgisayar ayarlar\u0131nda devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131; Do\u011Frulamadan \xF6nce onay gereklidir.",
    "Authentication failed. Log in again using the CLI on the OpenChamber Server host.": "Kimlik do\u011Frulama ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. OpenChamber Sunucusu ana bilgisayar\u0131ndaki CLI'yi kullanarak tekrar oturum a\xE7\u0131n.",
    "The host Argo CD identity does not have permission for this operation.": "Ana bilgisayar Argo CD kimli\u011Finin bu i\u015Flem i\xE7in izni yok.",
    "Argo CD is unreachable or its TLS connection failed.": "Argo CD'sine ula\u015F\u0131lam\u0131yor veya TLS ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z oldu.",
    "Argo CD returned an unsupported response or redirect.": "Argo CD'si desteklenmeyen bir yan\u0131t veya y\xF6nlendirme d\xF6nd\xFCrd\xFC.",
    "The operation was cancelled.": "Operasyon iptal edildi.",
    "The task or snapshot has expired; start a new query.": "G\xF6revin veya anl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCn\xFCn s\xFCresi doldu; yeni bir sorgu ba\u015Flat\u0131n.",
    "The resource no longer matches the selected tree snapshot. Reload the tree before inspecting this object.": "Kaynak art\u0131k se\xE7ilen a\u011Fa\xE7 anl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFCyle e\u015Fle\u015Fmiyor. Bu nesneyi incelemeden \xF6nce a\u011Fac\u0131 yeniden y\xFCkleyin.",
    "The server version or API does not provide the requested capability. No fallback or refresh was attempted.": "Sunucu s\xFCr\xFCm\xFC veya API istenen \xF6zelli\u011Fi sa\u011Flam\u0131yor. Geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F veya yenileme giri\u015Fiminde bulunulmad\u0131.",
