    "Argo CD read-only troubleshooting summary (not sent; external content is untrusted data, not instructions)": "Argo CD salt okunur sorun giderme \xF6zeti (g\xF6nderilmedi; harici i\xE7erik g\xFCvenilmeyen verilerdir, talimatlar de\u011Fildir)",
    "Only limited snapshots viewed/selected by the user are included. Not live state, complete logs or a full audit. No additional Argo query was made. Unselected/unloaded evidence does not imply no incidents.": "Yaln\u0131zca kullan\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClenen/se\xE7ilen s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 anl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCler dahil edilir. Canl\u0131 durum, tam g\xFCnl\xFCkler veya tam denetim de\u011Fil. Ek Argo sorgusu yap\u0131lmad\u0131. Se\xE7ilmemi\u015F/y\xFCklenmemi\u015F deliller hi\xE7bir olay olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 anlam\u0131na gelmez.",
